+This module keeps the paper's native growing-domain binary CSP.  It samples two
+assignments first, then samples every random relation uniformly conditional on
+containing the tuples induced by those assignments.  Either planted assignment
+is therefore a certificate known by construction; ``verify`` only performs
+exact membership tests in the displayed relations.
