+        "the near-threshold growing-domain regime k=2, alpha=3/5, p=1/2 and "
+        "shipping r=21/25<r_c=3/(5 ln 2), while the MAC backtracker's measured "
+        "node and wall-clock cost are recorded by selftest G5."
